use firn/tags

protonup-qt is a Module
protonup-qt is tagged gaming

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  option myConfig.modules.protonup-qt.enable: enable "ProtonUp-Qt compatibility tool manager"
  config when config.myConfig.modules.protonup-qt.enable
    environment.systemPackages: with pkgs: [protonup-qt]
